+	// [SAMPLING 111] bit 4 is the mode - see the note on m_adc_stereo for how it was measured. The old
+	// LEFT-DMA / RIGHT-DMA names are gone because bit 1 is set in every value the firmware ever writes
+	// here and bit 2 in none of them, so neither one selects anything.
+	m_adc_stereo = BIT(data, 4);
